  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Organisational strengthening for supporting human rights defenders and indigenous community leaders</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to strengthen the new human rights NGO &quot;Rights Without Borders&quot; (Derechos Humanos Sin Fronteras) in order to promote and defend individual and collective, civic, economic, social, cultural and environmental rights of women and men, and their grassroots social organisations in the highland provinces of Peru&apos;s Cuzco region (Chumbivilcas, Espinar and Paruro). The indigenous and small farmer population of these provinces continues to suffer high levels of poverty, exclusion and violation of their human rights.</narrative>
  </description>
